        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Throne</strong> is a tower defense strategy game set in a dark, mist-shrouded world on the brink of collapse. As the ruler of the final kingdom still standing, you must command your defenses, outsmart relentless waves of monstrous creatures, and make crucial tactical decisions to hold your ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mist grows thicker. The monsters grow stronger. Will your kingdom be the last to fall—or the last to endure?<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 <strong>Defend the Last Kingdom</strong> – Strategically place towers and units to repel increasingly powerful waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌫️ <strong>Survive the Mist</strong> – Face unique challenges from the mysterious mist that cloaks the battlefield and spawns terrifying foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Deep Strategy</strong> – Adapt your tactics, manage resources, and unlock powerful upgrades to turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Epic Battles</strong> – Engage in intense, fast-paced encounters with hordes of monsters determined to destroy your throne.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your defenses hold—or will the last light of hope be snuffed out?</p>",
